---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="SMS Lead Alert Program | Restoration AI"
  description="How Restoration AI's SMS lead alert program works: who receives messages, how consent is given, and how to opt out."
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-24 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="bg-[#020617] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] -z-10"></div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">SMS Lead Alert Program</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 mb-10">Restoration AI LLC &middot; Last updated September 16, 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">What this program is</h2>
          <p>Restoration AI LLC sends transactional SMS lead alerts to the business owners and staff of
          its contracted clients. When a visitor submits an estimate request on a client's website,
          the client receives a text message with the lead's name, phone number, city, and a short
          description, so they can respond quickly.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">How consent is given</h2>
          <p>Recipients are Restoration AI's own contracted business clients. A client opts in by adding
          a phone number to the <em>Lead Notifications</em> panel of their Restoration AI dashboard
          (app.restorationai.io), which states: "By adding a number you agree to receive SMS lead
          alerts from Restoration AI at that number. Message and data rates may apply. Message
          frequency varies with lead volume. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help." Numbers are only
          ever added by the client or at the client's explicit request.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Message content and frequency</h2>
          <p>Messages are limited to lead notifications for the client's own business. A typical message:
          "New estimate request: Jane D. (555) 201-4477, Federal Way &mdash; water damage in basement."
          Frequency varies with the client's lead volume; most clients receive between a few messages
          per week and a few per day.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Opting out</h2>
          <p>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to stop receiving alerts at that number, or remove
          the number from the Lead Notifications panel. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> or email
          <a href="mailto:contact@restorationai.io" class="text-blue-400">contact@restorationai.io</a>
          for assistance. Message and data rates may apply.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Privacy</h2>
          <p>Phone numbers enrolled in this program are used only to deliver these alerts. No mobile
          information is shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.
          See our <a href="/privacy" class="text-blue-400">Privacy Policy</a> and
          <a href="/terms" class="text-blue-400">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>Restoration AI LLC<br/>7465 Bella Vista Road, Atascadero, CA 93422<br/>
          <a href="mailto:contact@restorationai.io" class="text-blue-400">contact@restorationai.io</a></p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
